    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ier41">
        <head xml:id="gom-ier41-Hd1e98">Caput 41</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier41-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier41-Hd1e102">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier41-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier41-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier41_8@1-7">Decem viri reperti sunt inter eos,</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier41-Qd1e109"><seg type="qs">etc., <quote xml:id="gom-ier41-Qd1e112" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier41_8@16-17">habemus thesaurum.</quote> Thesaurus enim in agro</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Per calcaneum enim, qui finis est corporis, terminus significatur actionis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier41-Dd1e121">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier41-Hd1e123">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier41-d1e125">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier41-Qd1e127" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier41_16@1-13">Tulit ergo Johanan filius Careae et omnes principes bellatorum qui erant cum eo,</quote>
            etc. Hanc fugam reliquiarum et transitum contra verbum Domini in Aegyptum quem Jeremias longa narratione hic retexuit, longe ante Isaias praedixit, centum scilicet quinquaginta annis, qui fuerunt inter Isaiam et Jeremiam, dicens: <quote xml:id="gom-ier41-Qd1e130" source="http://scta.info/resource/is30_1@1-12">Vae filii desertores, dicit Dominus, ut faceritis consilium, et non ex me</quote>, etc.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
